    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/a03432f93eeffc80ad875e21aece97d9.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/a03432f93eeffc80ad875e21aece97d9.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/a03432f93eeffc80ad875e21aece97d9.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insect Dude! Underground Roots</strong> is a\u00a02D-3D hybrid story-driven top-down shooter where the protagonist is trapped underground at the size of a bug and has to battle other insects while trying to find a way to return to normal.<br><br>In the journey he will discover a few <strong>dark secrets</strong> from a whole new perspective and.....<br><br>....maybe he isn't as alone as he might think...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/1bb23cfce0285d22a03a12f13470062a.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/1bb23cfce0285d22a03a12f13470062a.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/1bb23cfce0285d22a03a12f13470062a.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Root Traveling:</strong> Navigate through the underground ecosystem through the tree's roots using your suit's technology. Every level hides new challenges and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/5dda61c907946eec4190181b99a788d7.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/5dda61c907946eec4190181b99a788d7.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/5dda61c907946eec4190181b99a788d7.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Abilities:</strong> Unlock and upgrade equipment in your suit that allows you to defeat enemies in different ways.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6c5658e6088ebe0c325ed12155f461d1.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6c5658e6088ebe0c325ed12155f461d1.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6c5658e6088ebe0c325ed12155f461d1.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Music:</strong> The music system smoothly adapts to your current situation, setting the right mood whether you are in a battle or just exploring.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/498b77898a5fb061fb70efdeeed84cee.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/498b77898a5fb061fb70efdeeed84cee.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/498b77898a5fb061fb70efdeeed84cee.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Secrets:\u00a0</strong>Every step deeper brings unexpected hazards and escalating dangers, as well as many secrets... Find out what happened.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/0304968031cae8e74e63dac0ab360315.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/0304968031cae8e74e63dac0ab360315.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/0304968031cae8e74e63dac0ab360315.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F U N.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6d2d77c8cd143522bf618176a194afe4.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6d2d77c8cd143522bf618176a194afe4.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6d2d77c8cd143522bf618176a194afe4.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Green Industries</u></i></strong> is one of the most technologically advanced companies in the world. Its founder, <strong><i><u>Nathaniel Green</u></i></strong>, has been <strong>missing</strong> for the past <i>two years</i>, and no one knows what has happened to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite this, the company has continued to thrive. One of the local labs is owned by <strong><i><u>Arthur Drake</u></i></strong>, a brilliant scientist specializing in atomic distances and nanotechnology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He commissioned a special suit from a colleague to implement his theory, but during testing, <i>something went wrong</i>. As a result, he has <i>shrunk down</i> to the size of an insect and must now rely on the <strong>roots</strong> of a tree to travel and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/4ce6147deebd7d929acaa6fd66f2a5fc.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/4ce6147deebd7d929acaa6fd66f2a5fc.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/f644500a5993978b6538b703cff668d5.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=350 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/f644500a5993978b6538b703cff668d5.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/7cc93a2922e29de4193dd869e40c4b14.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/7cc93a2922e29de4193dd869e40c4b14.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/7cc93a2922e29de4193dd869e40c4b14.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Insect Dude! Underground Roots</i>, the gameplay focuses on exploring underground environments, eliminating enemies, and navigating through unique challenges in a 2D-3D hybrid setting. Players control the protagonist from a top-down perspective, navigating through an alien-like world with hostile insects and environmental hazards. Combat emphasizes quick reflexes and strategic use of each weapon and ability at the player's disposal, allowing players to shoot, dodge, and adapt to the fast-paced threats of each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay also integrates platforming elements at certain phases, requiring players to make precise movements across obstacles while maintaining situational awareness. As players progress, they uncover equipment upgrades and environmental interactions that aid in survival, adding depth and variation to each level. Environmental sound cues and visual indicators are essential, providing hints for direction and foreshadowing upcoming dangers. This blend of combat, exploration, and tactical movement creates a layered experience, pushing players to adapt to an evolving underground ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/a03432f93eeffc80ad875e21aece97d9.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/a03432f93eeffc80ad875e21aece97d9.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/a03432f93eeffc80ad875e21aece97d9.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insect Dude! Underground Roots</strong> is a\u00a02D-3D hybrid story-driven top-down shooter where the protagonist is trapped underground at the size of a bug and has to battle other insects while trying to find a way to return to normal.<br><br>In the journey he will discover a few <strong>dark secrets</strong> from a whole new perspective and.....<br><br>....maybe he isn't as alone as he might think...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/1bb23cfce0285d22a03a12f13470062a.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/1bb23cfce0285d22a03a12f13470062a.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/1bb23cfce0285d22a03a12f13470062a.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Root Traveling:</strong> Navigate through the underground ecosystem through the tree's roots using your suit's technology. Every level hides new challenges and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/5dda61c907946eec4190181b99a788d7.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/5dda61c907946eec4190181b99a788d7.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/5dda61c907946eec4190181b99a788d7.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Abilities:</strong> Unlock and upgrade equipment in your suit that allows you to defeat enemies in different ways.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6c5658e6088ebe0c325ed12155f461d1.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6c5658e6088ebe0c325ed12155f461d1.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6c5658e6088ebe0c325ed12155f461d1.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Music:</strong> The music system smoothly adapts to your current situation, setting the right mood whether you are in a battle or just exploring.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/498b77898a5fb061fb70efdeeed84cee.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/498b77898a5fb061fb70efdeeed84cee.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/498b77898a5fb061fb70efdeeed84cee.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Secrets:\u00a0</strong>Every step deeper brings unexpected hazards and escalating dangers, as well as many secrets... Find out what happened.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/0304968031cae8e74e63dac0ab360315.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/0304968031cae8e74e63dac0ab360315.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/0304968031cae8e74e63dac0ab360315.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F U N.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6d2d77c8cd143522bf618176a194afe4.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6d2d77c8cd143522bf618176a194afe4.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/6d2d77c8cd143522bf618176a194afe4.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Green Industries</u></i></strong> is one of the most technologically advanced companies in the world. Its founder, <strong><i><u>Nathaniel Green</u></i></strong>, has been <strong>missing</strong> for the past <i>two years</i>, and no one knows what has happened to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite this, the company has continued to thrive. One of the local labs is owned by <strong><i><u>Arthur Drake</u></i></strong>, a brilliant scientist specializing in atomic distances and nanotechnology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He commissioned a special suit from a colleague to implement his theory, but during testing, <i>something went wrong</i>. As a result, he has <i>shrunk down</i> to the size of an insect and must now rely on the <strong>roots</strong> of a tree to travel and find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/4ce6147deebd7d929acaa6fd66f2a5fc.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/4ce6147deebd7d929acaa6fd66f2a5fc.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/f644500a5993978b6538b703cff668d5.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=350 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/f644500a5993978b6538b703cff668d5.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/7cc93a2922e29de4193dd869e40c4b14.poster.avif?t=1745911878\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/7cc93a2922e29de4193dd869e40c4b14.webm?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295010/extras/7cc93a2922e29de4193dd869e40c4b14.mp4?t=1745911878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Insect Dude! Underground Roots</i>, the gameplay focuses on exploring underground environments, eliminating enemies, and navigating through unique challenges in a 2D-3D hybrid setting. Players control the protagonist from a top-down perspective, navigating through an alien-like world with hostile insects and environmental hazards. Combat emphasizes quick reflexes and strategic use of each weapon and ability at the player's disposal, allowing players to shoot, dodge, and adapt to the fast-paced threats of each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay also integrates platforming elements at certain phases, requiring players to make precise movements across obstacles while maintaining situational awareness. As players progress, they uncover equipment upgrades and environmental interactions that aid in survival, adding depth and variation to each level. Environmental sound cues and visual indicators are essential, providing hints for direction and foreshadowing upcoming dangers. This blend of combat, exploration, and tactical movement creates a layered experience, pushing players to adapt to an evolving underground ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
